flowchart TD
    A[Detect and report] --> B[Analyze scope, confidence, impact]
    B --> C{Crisis criteria met?}
    C -- Yes --> D[Activate crisis governance]
    C -- No --> E[Incident response governance]
    D --> F[Executive coordination and decisions]
    E --> G[Contain and preserve evidence]
    F --> G
    G --> H[Eradicate and establish trusted control]
    H --> I[Recover by dependency and business priority]
    I --> J[Security, data, technical, business validation]
    J --> K{Recovery gates met?}
    K -- No --> I
    K -- Yes --> L[Resume and monitor]
    L --> M[Stand down, review, improve]
